window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From </b><b><i>Beat It</i></b><b> to </b><b><i>Billie Jean</i></b><b>, the songs we know and love take on a brand-new, thrilling connotation in this anthology edited by Don Bruns.</b></p> <p>In this second collection in the Music and Murder Mystery series, nine award-winning, bestselling authors have written their own interpretations of the <i>Thriller</i> song list. With original work from some of the best mystery authors out there, the anthology includes stories from Heather Graham, Jeffery Deaver, William Kent Krueger, Dahlia Rose, and David R. Slayton, among others.</p> <p>With poignant, frightening, and intriguing stories from some of the best writers in the genre, this eerie collection is sure to keep you up at night—and maybe even haunt your dreams.</p>"; 
